 oute: [WE Tick Tock Trek Reverse (23R)](https://routes.lancasterbikeclub.n
 et/cue/we-tick-tock-trek-reverse-23r/)\n**Be Safe\, Have Fun\, and Ride To
 gether**\n\nThis is a Casual D Class ride. The ride leader will ride at th
 e advertised average speed. This is intended to be a group ride with a no-
