 he group together with occasional regroupings and/or splitting into multip
 le groups to align to pace capabilities.\n\nPlease do not join this ride i
 f you are not willing to ride with the group. If you exceed the posted pac
 e\, you will be riding by yourself and encouraged to join a faster group. 
 If maintaining a 12-14 mph average is beyond your current ability level\, 
 please consider joining a slower ride first.\n\nHelmets are mandatory. No 
 earbuds. Please bring water and a basic repair kit (spare tube\, tire leve
 rs\, pump/CO2 inflator).\n\nTo eliminate passing around a pen and paper wa
 iver\, we require LBC Club membership and Meetup RSVP below to join this r
