 for food and water purchases . Be sure to bring plenty of water and other 
 fluids as well as snack as there is no official stocked rest stops.**\n**T
 he ride leader will ride at the advertised pace of approx. 12-13mph on ava
 rage. Some riders may ride faster than the leader so we'll likely break in
